 sec('which-time','Which time matters: station, counter or boarding gate?',table(['Time','What you need to have done'],[
 ('Airport-ready target','Reach the correct terminal with documents and bags ready to begin airline procedures.'),('Check-in / bag-drop deadline','Finish the procedure required by your airline; online check-in may still leave baggage or document checks.'),('Boarding deadline','Be at the gate by the airline’s time. This can be well before the scheduled takeoff.')])+p('The airport station’s arrival time is not the counter arrival time. Keep the walk through the terminal in the journey calculation. This guide concerns international departures from the city; domestic flights and flight-to-flight connections have separate requirements.')),
