 sec('hnd-midnight','After-midnight example: use the previous date',p('For <strong>21 November, 00:30</strong>, the target is <strong>20 November, 21:30</strong>. Subtracting an illustrative 90-minute journey and 20-minute pickup gives <strong>19:40 on 20 November</strong> as the end of sightseeing. The planner accepts the flight and free time on different dates and displays JST.')),
 sec('hnd-buffer','When three hours is not the right target',p('An earlier airline instruction, assistance arrangement or substantial disruption takes priority. A shorter check-in deadline printed by the airline is not a recommendation to arrive at the last possible minute. The purpose of this allowance is to leave room for terminal navigation and variable queues.')+earlier())
