 sec('nrt-do-less','When doing less buys a better final afternoon',p('If bags are at a Shinjuku hotel and the airport is Narita, a final Shinjuku meal followed by the airport train can be more rewarding than crossing to Asakusa and back. If the weather turns after reaching Narita town, shorten the street walk, collect the case and eat at the terminal. Neither choice wastes the day: it replaces uncertain queues with time you can actually use.')+earlier())
