 sec('kix-train-choice','Fastest ride is not always the shortest whole journey',p('Nankai’s advertised Rapi:t and Airport Express times begin at Nankai Namba. If you are at a hotel north of Osaka Station, reaching Namba first can remove the apparent advantage. Compare the complete route from the actual bag location, including platform access, waiting and the terminal end.')+p('Kansai-airport Station is connected to T1 and Aeroplaza. T2 uses the Aeroplaza 1F shuttle; its 7–9-minute ride does not include walking or waiting. '+a('/guides/how-early-arrive-kansai-airport/','The KIX arrival guide shows both T1 and T2 calculations')+'.')),
 sec('kix-rinku','When Rinku is the wrong final addition',p('Skip the outlet detour when you have already bought what you wanted, when a case is still in central Osaka, or when heavy rain makes the walk unpleasant. The value of being near the airport disappears if you must first travel away to retrieve bags. Choose a final meal at KIX instead.')+earlier())
